{"4512770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Once There Were Cats", "steam_appid": 4512770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once There Were Cats</strong> is a game of wits and wizardry, an RPG where you fight enemies by solving trivia. Explore the harvest gothic world of The Gloam alongside your duck sidekick, gather powerful artifacts, and encounter mythical creatures on your way to the Quizard's tower, where your fate awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pre-alpha demo, designed to capture the vibe and gameplay features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUIZ-BASED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In OTWC the combat system revolves around solving multiple-choice questions, such as trivia, riddles, puzzles etc. Think fast! You need to answer before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEWARE OF MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gloam is home to monsters drawn from global folklore. Monsters in <strong>OTWC</strong> have special attacks and ask questions based on their personality, nature and origins. They can poison you, set you on fire, blind you, confuse you… if you let them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPELLCASTER WIZARD CAT, KILL! KILL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you didn’t pay attention in school and don’t know the answers, don’t worry: you can use spells to eliminate answers, slow down the timer, skip questions, change topics or inflict damage. Try incinerating a kappa with a fireball! It’s one of life’s great pleasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/c44d2b2c4bf35b46dc5d8e771cb8049d.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/c44d2b2c4bf35b46dc5d8e771cb8049d.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/c44d2b2c4bf35b46dc5d8e771cb8049d.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE A DUCK FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re really stuck you can always call on your duck sidekick <strong>Sir Goo Goo</strong> to suggest an answer. He’ll do his best, but he is a duck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/f5a255bcb271a82fdee02ec87e5eaedc.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/f5a255bcb271a82fdee02ec87e5eaedc.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/f5a255bcb271a82fdee02ec87e5eaedc.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT POWERFUL ARTIFACTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your adventures, you’ll come across tons of cool wands, grimoires and artifacts you can equip that will give you special abilities and cater to your playstyle. If you think you know all the answers, try making a risky offensive build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/45a5c2ca1cbfdb88e62fbd2f3166cd14.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/45a5c2ca1cbfdb88e62fbd2f3166cd14.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/45a5c2ca1cbfdb88e62fbd2f3166cd14.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EAT LOTS OF FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventuring through The Gloam is sure to make a kitty hungry. But don’t worry, there are lots of delicious things for you to eat. Rare foods even provide unique buffs in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLEEP IN BOXES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get tired, why not take a nap in a cozy cat-sized box? Who knows what you’ll dream of when you slumber… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE GLOAM &amp; MAKE FRIENDS WITH WEIRDOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides fighting, there is a whole strange world to explore, full of quirky creatures, side quests, easter eggs and puzzles. Talk to everyone, sometimes you can even talk to inanimate objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH A BALL OF YARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is pretty much self-explanatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOVER YOUR MEMORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to all the other cats? Who is Char? Where am you? What am you? It’s up to you to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU SMART ENOUGH???</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t really have to be that smart, so we think yes, you are smart enough! You are strong enough! Don’t be a scaredy cat! Play OTWC today, you budding genius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cats or ducks were harmed during the production of the Once There Were Cats demo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/37f2d4530f0f01d0fed8b108baa717ab.avif?t=1777481185\" width=1000 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once There Were Cats</strong> is a game of wits and wizardry, an RPG where you fight enemies by solving trivia. Explore the harvest gothic world of The Gloam alongside your duck sidekick, gather powerful artifacts, and encounter mythical creatures on your way to the Quizard's tower, where your fate awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pre-alpha demo, designed to capture the vibe and gameplay features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUIZ-BASED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In OTWC the combat system revolves around solving multiple-choice questions, such as trivia, riddles, puzzles etc. Think fast! You need to answer before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/38f6d08429010eb7cc941015889e89dc.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEWARE OF MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gloam is home to monsters drawn from global folklore. Monsters in <strong>OTWC</strong> have special attacks and ask questions based on their personality, nature and origins. They can poison you, set you on fire, blind you, confuse you… if you let them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/290b22d5232c88fa4c6e8d5f28223bef.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPELLCASTER WIZARD CAT, KILL! KILL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you didn’t pay attention in school and don’t know the answers, don’t worry: you can use spells to eliminate answers, slow down the timer, skip questions, change topics or inflict damage. Try incinerating a kappa with a fireball! It’s one of life’s great pleasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https