1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/45a5c2ca1cbfdb88e62fbd2f3166cd14.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/45a5c2ca1cbfdb88e62fbd2f3166cd14.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EAT LOTS OF FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventuring through The Gloam is sure to make a kitty hungry. But don’t worry, there are lots of delicious things for you to eat. Rare foods even provide unique buffs in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/16b3d97916276065dc2d6f357f870bf4.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLEEP IN BOXES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get tired, why not take a nap in a cozy cat-sized box? Who knows what you’ll dream of when you slumber… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/1e4f179475b446d2b8f7c6ca718becb1.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE GLOAM &amp; MAKE FRIENDS WITH WEIRDOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides fighting, there is a whole strange world to explore, full of quirky creatures, side quests, easter eggs and puzzles. Talk to everyone, sometimes you can even talk to inanimate objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/81de8a4a7658ad5a3e34d56ebc57aa91.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH A BALL OF YARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is pretty much self-explanatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/b7fb78acfe9a4a1118976890700f3409.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOVER YOUR MEMORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to all the other cats? Who is Char? Where am you? What am you? It’s up to you to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/2cdd7b3b57a6d06202e6cba146b55c40.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU SMART ENOUGH???</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t really have to be that smart, so we think yes, you are smart enough! You are strong enough! Don’t be a scaredy cat! Play OTWC today, you budding genius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.poster.avif?t=1777481185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.webm?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/ca0da33eeece85b14a12578a380c7b6e.mp4?t=1777481185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cats or ducks were harmed during the production of the Once There Were Cats demo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/extras/37f2d4530f0f01d0fed8b108baa717ab.avif?t=1777481185\" width=1000 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Once There Were Cats is a game of wits and wizardry, an RPG where you fight enemies by solving trivia. Explore the harvest gothic world of The Gloam alongside your duck sidekick, gather powerful artifacts, and encounter mythical creatures on your way to the Quizards tower, where your fate awaits.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/66a1e39f7fb01d5bb5fb7b9b9bec97ab7771ab6d/header.jpg?t=1777481185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/93b8e7bc91a1f6760049c342bf95a53cb5a7d81d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777481185", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512770/93b8e7bc91a1f6760049c342bf95a53cb5a7d81d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777481185", "website": "https://www.albedoinformatics.com/otwc", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything from the past decade<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> You do you &lt;3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything from the past decade<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Albedo Informatics"], "publishers": ["Albedo Informatics"], "demos": [{"appid": 4537720, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "descrip